                  <div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 truncate">KB-2025-0421 • Bima Satria Wicaksono</p><p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5 truncate">Hotplate Stirrer Keramik • Selesai &amp; Sah</p></div>
                </label>
